<title>HONG KONG: China EB Tech interim net returns to black.</title>
<headline>China EB Tech interim net returns to black.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.6 gain     vs 3.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  94.14 gain   vs 13.88 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    74.60 profit vs 37.45 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     65.21	  vs 241.05</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Everbright Technology Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Everbright Technology manufactures television sets and audio products for private-label customers.</p>
<p>Exceptional gain represents profit on sale of colour television and consumer audio products manufacturing subsidiaries and associated companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
